<title>CHINA: China Jan-Apr diesel output up 10.1 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Apr diesel output up 10.1 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>China produced 15.4443 million tonnes of diesel in the first four months of this year, up 10.1 percent compared with the year-ago period, the State Statistical Bureau said on Thursday.</p>
<p>China produced 3.8059 million tonnes of diesel in April, the bureau said. It gave no comparison for the year ago.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532 1921</p>
</text>
